{
  "_comment": "per-country delivery breakdown of Facebook ad insights ({team_esid}__fb_insights_country): one doc per ad x day x delivery country, written by import_scripts/facebook/get_insights.py from a second account-level insights call with breakdowns=[country]. Kept OUT of *_fb_insights so no existing tile double-counts impressions/clicks. Hand-maintained (not generated from the fb_ads catalog — the catalog governs the platform docs' field picker, which does not apply here).",
